<in-bse-shp:DisclosureOfNotesOnShareholdingPatternExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneI">1. Note for Table II and Table V:  - During the fourth quarter, two new entities were incorporated which are covered under the promoter group of the Company: 1) Vedanta Netherlands Investments II BV; and 2)  Vedanta Resources Mauritius Limited. - The American Depositary Shares (ADS) of the Company have been delisted effective close of trading on NYSE on November 08, 2021. Further, post January 11, 2022, the ADS underlying equity shares which were not surrendered in accordance with the Deposit Agreement within the extended timelines i.e., January 10, 2022, were sold by the depositary and the proceeds, less and withholding taxes, fees and expenses were remitted to the ADS holders. Hence, as on March 31, 2022, there were no outstanding ADS of the Company.  2. Note for Table III:  - 3,05,832 shares are under abeyance category, pending for allotment as they are subjudice.  3. Note for Table IV:  - As per Regulation 3(5) of the SEBl(Share based Employee Benefit) Regulations 2014 the voting rights of Vedanta Limited ESOS Trust are reserved.  4. Note for Table V:  - Vedanta Limited is a majority-owned and controlled subsidiary of Vedanta Resources Limited (‘VRL’). Volcan Investments Limited (‘Volcan’) and its subsidiary hold 100.0% of the share capital and 100.0% of the voting rights of VRL. Volcan is a holding company, 100.0% beneficially owned and controlled by the Anil Agarwal Discretionary Trust (‘Trust’). Conclave PTC Limited (‘Conclave’) is the trustee of the Trust and the sole registered shareholder of Volcan. VRL’s  shares are beneficially owned by Volcan which may be deemed to be beneficially owned by the Trust, of which Mr. Anil Agarwal is the protector and with effect from October 16, 2014, one of the beneficiaries.</in-bse-shp:DisclosureOfNotesOnShareholdingPatternExplanatoryTextBlock>
